      "assessment": "The contents listing names Thunderbolts (1997) #1-5 and #-1, Incredible Hulk (1968) #449, Tales of the Marvel Universe #1, Spider-Man Team-Up #7 and Thunderbolts Annual '97. Preserve that listing order rather than silently moving Hulk before the named Thunderbolts range. The provider labels Hulk's series 1962 and Tales 1996; these factual identity aliases do not change the selected originals."
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "originalSelection": "Black Widow by Kelly Thompson Vol. 1: The Ties That Bind: modern, movie-aligned take on Yelena Belova as a lead, not a sidekick.",
