      "ownerDecisionUrl": "https://github.com/raymond-nassar/recap-page/issues/682#issuecomment-5971692441",
      "assessment": "The owner explicitly approved the Ultimate Collection: Captain America (2004) #1-9 and #11-14, thirteen original issues. Exclude the House of M #10 tie-in, Book One-only truncation and the rest of Brubaker's run. Bibliographies using the 2005 cover-date year refer to provider series 832, Captain America (2004 - 2011)."
    },
    {
      "position": 4,
      "originalSelection": "Thunderbolts by Jim Zub Vol. 1: Life Sentences: recent run with Bucky, Red Guardian, Ghost, and Taskmaster on the roster, closely mirroring the film's team.",
      "resolvedTitle": "Thunderbolts Vol. 1: There Is No High Road",
