      "ownerDecisionUrl": "https://github.com/raymond-nassar/recap-page/issues/682#issuecomment-5971667297",
      "assessment": "The owner approved Jim Zub's actual first collection, Thunderbolts (2016) #1-6, with corrected roster copy. Bucky leads this team; do not claim a Red Guardian/Ghost/Taskmaster roster or a literal film match. Thunderbolts: Life Sentences names a separate 2001 one-shot, not this volume. The rejected title conflation is a resolved bibliography decision, not a provider gap."
    },
    {
      "position": 5,
      "originalSelection": "Hawkeye: Red Vendetta/Occupy Avengers era one-shot featuring Taskmaster or U.S.Agent (pick a short Taskmaster/Agent spotlight issue): quick characterization boost for the rounder roster.",
