      "selectionDecision": "Exercise the owner's explicit permission to choose exactly one short Taskmaster or U.S.Agent spotlight: Taskmaster (2020) #1, issue 78850, series 28068, 32 pages. This is a miniseries opener, not a fabricated titled one-shot, a complete miniseries or the film's particular Taskmaster incarnation.",
      "assessment": "No exact Hawkeye: Red Vendetta publication identity was verified; the configured title search returned zero records. Occupy Avengers is a real nine-issue 2016 series, but a matching Taskmaster/U.S.Agent spotlight one-shot was not established. Those imprecise input hints are not provider gaps and do not authorize importing that series. The one original spotlight issue is uncollected and must not be advertised as a fifth collected edition."
